WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:03.200 --> 00:07.800
Keep the Marching Forgers right here with us!

00:12.000 --> 00:15.200
Thirty years ago in 1986,

00:15.800 --> 00:19.800
Evan and Tyler walked into our basement

00:20.200 --> 00:25.200
and we wrote our very first song together about the cosmos

00:25.200 --> 00:28.500
and the rockets that get you there!

00:31.000 --> 00:35.800
Let's hear it, CPI!

01:03.200 --> 01:06.200
We were looking for a signal

01:06.800 --> 01:10.000
A light in the endless black

01:10.500 --> 01:13.800
A single voice in the universe

01:13.800 --> 01:16.800
To tell us we're on the right track

01:18.000 --> 01:21.200
We found the fire in the wires

01:21.800 --> 01:25.200
We found the heart in the machine

01:25.500 --> 01:28.500
Building a dream from nothing

01:28.500 --> 01:31.800
A sound the world has never seen

01:32.200 --> 01:39.200
We are the Stardust Engine!

01:39.200 --> 01:41.500
Racing through the night

01:41.500 --> 01:46.800
We're burning on the fuel of a brand new light

01:47.200 --> 01:54.200
We are the Stardust Engine!

01:54.200 --> 01:56.500
Yeah, we're taking flight

01:56.500 --> 02:02.000
Turning our future on, shining so bright!

02:13.500 --> 02:17.200
They tried to ground us, keep us small

02:17.500 --> 02:21.000
Tell us that we were gonna fall

02:21.200 --> 02:24.800
But they don't know the things we know

02:24.800 --> 02:28.800
They haven't seen the places we'll go

02:30.000 --> 02:36.800
We are the Stardust Engine!

02:36.800 --> 02:39.000
Racing through the night

02:39.000 --> 02:44.500
We're burning on the fuel of a brand new light

02:45.000 --> 02:51.800
We are the Stardust Engine!

02:51.800 --> 02:54.200
Yeah, we're taking flight

02:54.200 --> 03:02.000
Turning our future on, shining so bright!

03:24.500 --> 03:26.500
We are the cosmos

03:26.500 --> 03:28.500
We are the fire

03:28.500 --> 03:30.200
We're taking this one

03:30.200 --> 03:32.500
Higher and higher

03:32.500 --> 03:34.200
We are the Stardust!

03:34.200 --> 03:39.200
(We are the Engine!)

03:39.200 --> 03:44.500
We are the Stardust Engine!

